<title>USA: Ride in talks to sell sales segment of unit.</title>
<headline>Ride in talks to sell sales segment of unit.</headline>
<dateline>PRESTON, Wash. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ride Inc said on Wednesday it has entered negotiations to sell excess inventory sales segment of its subsidiary C.A.S. Sports International Inc to a management-led group of C.A.S. Sports employees.</p>
<p>The company will retain all other aspects of the subsidiary's business operations.</p>
<p>It said the deal is subject to the negotiation of a definitive agreement and customary due diligence procedures.</p>
<p>Ride acquired C.A.S. Sports in August 1994.</p>
</text>
